  "description": "With the Altura CP Plus you get a unisex electric bike with a comfortable low step-through frame, making it easy to get on and off — especially when carrying extra weight, such as a front basket or a child seat on the back. The bike is equipped with the brand-new BOSCH Smart System, also known as BES3, a system that is quiet, comfortable, and efficient.\nThis model features the BOSCH Active Plus motor, which provides smooth and reliable support. The battery is positioned in the rear carrier for easy access. The rear light includes the Batavus BRAKE-light, which enhances safety on the bike path by shining brighter when you brake. In addition, the bike is equipped with a practical handlebar lock, which is very useful when mounting a front basket. The suspension front fork ensures comfort when riding over uneven surfaces.",
